  "factor_name": "Positive-Path Quality Reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-pct_change(close,20) * mean(indicator(daily_return > 0),20) / downside_deviation(daily_return,30)",
    "description": "Contrarian cross-asset signal that fades 20-day performance, with stronger reversal exposure for returns achieved through a high fraction of positive sessions; scaled by trailing 30-day downside deviation. All inputs are backward-looking on the signal date. Higher values indicate greater expected forward return."
